alls the  Labour Party in the last few years  people are skeptical about your doing  your son's right you're getting the  economy right I understand that and that  but if we are we are at fundamental  stage you know we're just in the the  early stages of a new Parliament and I  don't think it's unreasonable for us to  sort of set out the direction of travel  without put in a price tag on everything  but what I thought was very interesting  yesterday from John McDonald speech I  mean he wants a fundamental review of  the way government  operates within the economy those  reviews of the Treasury in the Bank of  England were very very significant and  you know to bring in World economists  like Joseph Stiglitz who says you know  in a world where interest rates of  record lows you know maybe that's the  time you invest in capital  infrastructure that creates the jobs of  the future it's not unreasonable to set  the sort tone of the debate without  being specific in the early part of a  parliament I think well I very  interested it was our first experiment  in kinder gentler carrying political  interviews I think think we did all  right we'll see how well see what people  make of it Tom Watson thank you lady  with Thai boot I look forward to more  Jeremy thanks

